Written by hand for this repository on 2026-11-19 (CC0 1.0: no rights
reserved) for the design's embedded files (wave 2 plan, the properties and
setup addendum, section 10; island unit m13-i). A one sheet schematic with one
text and a two layer board, 40 by 20 mm (an Edge.Cuts rectangle), with one
silkscreen text, each text drawn in the outline font Noto Sans. Nothing is
embedded in the files committed here: tests/e2e/embedded-files.spec.ts, on an
engine with the cap designEmbedded (engine run 15), embeds the font through
embedded.set from KiCad's own copy, kicad-source-mirror/qa/resources/fonts/
NotoSans-Regular.ttf (SIL Open Font License 1.1, read by path from the engine
tree and never copied here), turns the fonts on, adds a one page PDF the spec
draws itself (CC0) to the board as a datasheet, and saves through KiCad; with
CC_M13_FIXTURE_OUT naming a folder the spec writes the two files KiCad saved
there, so the embedded versions can be committed as the files KiCad wrote.
The KiCad files carry no comment (their formats have none), so this file
holds their license.
